          "category": "agent-computer-use",
          "basis": "browser-evidence",
          "rationale": "Stripe is the process’s processor. Its Dashboard provides dispute analytics, export controls and a VAMP view with network-reported standing and Stripe estimates. Compare the applicable network formula and period with the processor’s notices; ordinary dispute rates can omit cases counted by the networks. Monitoring is browser work, while agreeing remediation or account changes remains with the responsible owner. Confirm access to the required program data and notification channel before relying on the assessment.",
          "evidence": [
            "open-processes/contain-a-chargeback-or-fraud-spike.json#/parts/5/title",
